 State of Mayflower, the County of Clark was created as one of the four original counties of the State of Mayflower.\n\nThe current county seat for the County of Clark is the Town of Mersea. Alongside the county seat, the County of Clark is home to the state seat for the State of Mayflower; the City of Lander.\n\nThis experience is constantly developing and is prone to changes, including shutdowns and the wipe of player data.\n\nThe in-game time period is in the early 2000s.","path":"/game/16541340872-clark-county","slug":"16541340872-clark-county","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c51779dc32f5daab51af80306dbedd6e85986b7094e676ce2e78118ff6631dd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-83c1c28152000990d8b8cd663edfb613/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":3176486,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-30T19:58:24.662Z","creator":{"name":"State οf Mayflowеr","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14123,"totalPages":589,"currentPage":304}